解: $(1)|2-\sqrt{3}|+2 \sin 60^{\circ}+\left(\frac{1}{3}\right)^{-1}-(\sqrt{2019}-1)^{0}$

$$
\begin{aligned}
= & 2-\sqrt{3}+2 \times \frac{\sqrt{3}}{2}+\frac{1}{\frac{1}{3}}-1 \\
= & 2-\sqrt{3}+\sqrt{3}+3-1
\end{aligned}
$$

$=4$;

$$
\begin{gathered}
\text { (2) } \frac{x^{2}-2 x+1}{x^{2}-1} \div\left(\frac{x-1}{x+1}-x+1\right) \\
=\frac{x^{2}-2 x+1}{x^{2}-1} \div \frac{x-1-(x-1)(x+1)}{x+1} \\
=\frac{(x-1)^{2}}{(x-1)(x+1)} \div \frac{-x(x-1)}{x+1} \\
=\frac{(x-1)^{2}}{(x-1)(x+1)} \times \frac{x+1}{-x(x-1)}
\end{gathered}
$$

$=-\frac{1}{x}$,

$\because x^{2}-3 x+2=0$,

$\therefore(x-2)(x-1)=0$,

$\therefore x=2$ 或 $x=1$,

当 $x=1$ 时, 分式无意义，则 $x=1$ 舍去;

当 $x=2$ 时, 原式 $=-\frac{1}{2}$.
